<a name="intro"></a>
<h3>Introduction</h3>

The <a href="../classes/html/classhostentry.html">hostentry class</a> provides methods for retrieveing information about hosts by hostname or address.


<a name="hostname"></a>
<h3>Lookup By Hostname</h3>

In this example, host information is retrieved by hostname.

